					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Teppei",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 20140501,
					"content": "Phew... glad that's over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140502,
					"content": "As monsters go, that one was pretty tough. But what's such a huge Thunderhelm Lawachurl doing here in the first place?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140503,
					"content": "It doesn't make any sense... Also, the atmosphere here gives Paimon the creeps.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140504,
					"content": "Anyway, the good thing is that it's over now. We should probably get going... Huh, Teppei? What are you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140505,
					"content": "*cough* ...Wow, this is a surprise. Didn't know you were the ones investigating here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140506,
					"content": "I just got back from delivering some supplies to the front line. I figured I'd stop by and clear any threats in this area on the way back. *cough*...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140507,
					"content": "Are you alright there buddy? You're looking slightly the worse for wear.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140508,
					"content": "I'm fine, it's nothing. I must've caught a cold a couple days ago while I was out at sea.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140509,
					"content": "On my way past, I heard that someone had just arrived on the island to investigate, so I thought I'd come and take a look.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140510,
					"content": "If there'd been some real danger, I might've had the chance to be the hero... Heh, shame it was just you guys. Guess I came here for nothing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140511,
					"content": "Teppei, don't you think there's something strange about this place?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140512,
					"content": "Hmm... now that you mention it, there is something a little off about it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140513,
					"content": "It could be that the Tatarigami is more palpable here, I guess. We're not that far away from Orobaxi's remains.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140514,
					"content": "Orobaxi? Who's that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140515,
					"content": "A god. Look, there's the corpse over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140516,
					"content": "Aah! It's a gigantic snake skeleton. It looks terrifying!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140517,
					"content": "Orobaxi was the one who brought our ancestors from Enkanomiya up to the surface. That's the origin of the Watatsumi Island you know today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140518,
					"content": "Our ancestors regarded it as a guardian deity, but during the Archon War, Orobaxi invaded Yashiori Island.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140519,
					"content": "The Raiden Shogun came out in person and slew Orobaxi with the Musou no Hitotachi. That same slash also formed what later became known as Musoujin Gorge.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140520,
					"content": "The Raiden Shogun created Musoujin Gorge in one slash? Wow, that's pretty incredible...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140521,
					"content": "Yes. But the Archon War was brutal... *cough* and Yashiori Island was completely destroyed during that battle. They say the shogun lost something very dear to her along the way too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140522,
					"content": "Since Orobaxi's death... *cough* there has always been some animosity between Watatsumi Island and the Shogunate. But our different beliefs have nothing to do with why the resistance was formed. We only rose up to fight against the Vision Hunt Decree.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140523,
					"content": "When Orobaxi attacked civilization, the shogun stood up and put a stop to it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140524,
					"content": "But now that the shogun is stripping people of their ambitions with the Vision Hunt Decree, it's time for someone to stand up and stop the shogun... *cough*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140525,
					"content": "Alright, I'm heading back. I was just dealing with some of the Shogun's elite samurai, so I think I'm gonna take a quick breather, then it's onto my next assignment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140526,
					"content": "You should report back to Sangonomiya as soon as possible. Don't stay here longer than you need to — being around the Tatarigami too long won't do your health any good...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140527,
					"content": "*coughing*...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140528,
						20140529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140528,
					"content": "Take care of yourself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140530
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20140530,
					"content": "Hey, don't worry about me. Peak condition...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Teppei"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140531,
					"content": "Teppei's sure made some big progress if he's already dealing with Shogunate Samurai. Paimon can hardly believe it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140532,
					"content": "#Let's report back to <color=#00E1FFFF>Kokomi</color>, {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20140529,
					"content": "Watch your back.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20140530
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 201406,
